:"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"Absent an exact id, a route equal to a declared alias resolves to the id of the item declaring the alias. Alias comparison lowercases and maps underscores to dashes."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-DQ9P","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"A row matches only when every query term appears in its name text (label, leaf id, aliases) or as a whole word in its description. Invisible and disabled rows never match."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-E4J2","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["input_domain"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-PPDW"],"title":"The parser strips full-line // comments and trailing commas before JSON parsing, so the authored JSONC parses to its declared entries."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-EFNR","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A"],"title":"swapProviderRows drops exactly the rows carrying the re-run provider's providerMenu and appends the new batch, leaving static children and other providers' rows untouched."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-HR29","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["external_call_timeout_bounded"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-6642","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-6642"],"title":"The listing matches the requested formats case-insensitively, prunes dotfiles and dot-directories, and sorts rows by modification time descending. The script rejects a nonexistent path on stderr with exit 1."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-JRW1","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-47T8","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-47T8"],"title":"Applied guard results drive the view. A row hides when its when: is false. A static submenu or link hides when no descendant is visible, while provider-backed menus stay visible. A checked:true or disabled:true row earns the check-mark label. A disabled row dims and skips the cursor."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-N3RM","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","SYS-REQ-260927-WC89"],"title":"When a route resolves to an action item with a non-empty action, the action runs directly and no menu opens."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-PRNV","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"An exact id match wins over every alias. App rows are never routable, so an installed app's keywords cannot shadow a menu route (htop ships Keywords=system)."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"Scores tier exact label, whole-word app name, label prefix, label substring, name text, then description. Menus and links promote by 2, apps demote by 5 within a tier. Final order breaks ties by depth then declaration order."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-TKDP","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-V7W6"],"title":"Search lists current-menu matches before deeper (drilldown) matches, with a divider section exactly when both groups are non-empty."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-XW52","matchLevel":"file","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-R8DQ"],"title":"When a route resolves to a link item, the menu opens at the link's target."},{"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-Z680","matchLevel":"file","obligations":["atomicity"],"parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A","relation":"code_changed","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-0M8A"],"title":"mergeAppRows and swapProviderRows return fresh maps th